								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I feel for you man...my son did the same shit...I dont know what it is with kids and playin with thier dirty diapers....<br /><br />First I used the better style of diapers, the ones that use tape are shitty. <br /><br />Things I tried:<br /><br />Velcro style diapers<br />Ducktape<br />Onesies<br />Overall style clothing with buttons that are hard to get off.<br />Staples<br />Hotglue<br /><br />Gotta love kids....
